== Prison of Sorrow ==

[[File:DQ6 Path to Sea of Nothingness.png|thumb|left|]]

[[File:DQ6 Path to Prison of Sorrow & Mortamor's Dreadlair.png|thumb|right|]]

There isn't much to this page.  Just use the exact same party as you did for Blackmar, use the Orb of Truth at the Sea of Nothingness, enter the Prison of Sorrow, witness Isaac's nightmares, Zoom back to Gallows Moor, talk to Benjamin, go back to the Prison of Sorrow, enter Isaac's nightmares, and initiate the boss fight.


